            "value": 0.433,
            "unit": "dimensionless"
          }
        },
        "source_text": "The pharmacokinetics models for gentamicin in blood were not statistically significantly different between the model without gentamicin versus the gentamicin with mannitol model (Table 1, p = 0.433 ; R² = 0.61 ). ... y0 = 184 (+/− 167–200) ng/ml; k = 0.045 (+/− 0.025–0.066 ) hrs −1 . ... half-life t1/2 , which was 15.3 (+/− 10.5–28.05) hours."
